  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/OpenVPN/easy-rsa/zipball/v3.2.7",
  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Chores: Fixed a typo in easy-rsa/easyrsa3/easyrsa shell output by @schwindp in https://github.com/OpenVPN/easy-rsa/pull/1445\r\n* default_vars(): If defined, set EASYRSA_SAN_CRIT to 'critical,' for use by @TinCanTech in https://github.com/OpenVPN/easy-rsa/pull/1448\r\n* verify_working_env(): Do not reset '$require_pki' and '$require_ca' by @TinCanTech in https://github.com/OpenVPN/easy-rsa/pull/1450\r\n* write: Load all variables before calling 'write()' by @TinCanTech in https://github.com/OpenVPN/easy-rsa/pull/1451\r\n* Fix git bash 4win by @TinCanTech in https://github.com/OpenVPN/easy-rsa/pull/1454\r\n* check_serial_unique(); Do not export EASYRSA_SSL_CONF for LibreSSL by @TinCanTech in https://github.com/OpenVPN/easy-rsa/pull/1466\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @schwindp made their first contribution in https://github.com/OpenVPN/easy-rsa/pull/1445\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/OpenVPN/easy-rsa/compare/v3.2.6...v3.2.7",
